Third-party material

The per-file list of assets (author, source, licence) is in ATTRIBUTION.md. Every asset in this
repository is original Tinta Office work.

Rust crates linked into the binaries keep their own licences (all MIT, Apache-2.0 or compatible
permissive licences; `cargo tree` lists them). Notably:
- mail-parser (Stalwart Labs) — Apache-2.0 OR MIT.
- egui / eframe — MIT OR Apache-2.0.
- rustls — Apache-2.0 OR ISC OR MIT; rustls-platform-verifier — MIT OR Apache-2.0.
- ring (cryptography) — Apache-2.0 AND ISC.
